## How to use this with your Playwright/loop setup

For each row, write one Playwright (or manual, where Playwright can't reach it — e.g. real audio, real multi-monitor unplug) test that reproduces the exact scenario and asserts the "expected behavior" column. Feed failures back into the same loop-prompt pattern you've been using: crash handler → real stack trace → targeted fix → re-verify 3x clean, never patch on a guess.